AiTask weekly_category_revenue_summary {
  label: "Weekly Revenue by Category"
  description: "Posts last week's revenue by category to Slack."

  brief: @md
    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get revenue by product category for the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    2. Write a concise Slack summary of total revenue and revenue for every product category, ordered from highest to lowest revenue. State the reporting period and use currency formatting.
    3. Write the result with the write_ai_task_result skill.

    Delivery: After every run, post the completed summary to the Slack channel #nhity-test.
  ;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    - Reports total revenue and revenue for every product category, ordered from highest to lowest revenue.
    - States the reporting period and formats monetary amounts as currency.
    - Posts the completed summary to #nhity-test after every run.
  ;;
}